  "excerpt": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">AATMANIRBHAR BHARATH</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\nInspired by the initiative AATMANIRBHAR BHARATH by the Honorable Prime Minister of India, ATME College of Engineering organized a series of webinars on “SELF SUSTENANCE THROUGH AATMANIRBHAR BHARATH” on 5th, 12th, 19th and 26th of August 2020, in association with Field Outreach Bureau Mysore, Ministry of information and Broadcasting Government of India. Renowned Educational Institutions from Mysuru were participated in the webinar. Around 660 participants had registered for the webinar series.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<a href=\"http://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Report-on-Webinar-series-on-Atma-nirbhara-Bharat.pdf\">Report on webinar series on “SELF SUSTENANCE THROUGH AATMANIRBHAR BHARATH”</a>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
